<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Be Back Soon!</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Down for maintenance!">
	
	<style>
	
		@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,100;0,200;0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,100;1,200;1,300;1,400;1,500;1,600;1,700;1,800;1,900&family=Caprasimo&display=swap');
	
        body {
            font-family: "Barlow Condensed", sans-serif;
			      font-weight: 500;
			      font-style: normal;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f0f2f5;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 50px 20px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .container {
            display: block;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            text-align: left;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: "Caprasimo", serif;
			      font-weight: 400;
			      font-style: normal;
            font-size: 56px;
			      color: #ec1f27;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h2 {
            font-size: 28px;
            color: #ec1f27;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h3 {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #34495e;
            margin-top: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #555;
        }

        a {
            color: #ec1f27;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        a:hover {
            color: orange;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 400px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            display: block;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .signature {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #777;
            text-align: center;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 38px;
            }
          
            .container {
                margin: 20px auto;
                padding: 30px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            h1 {
                font-size: 32px;
            }
          
            p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
          
            .container {
                padding: 20px;
            }
        }
    </style>

</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <img src="https://i.imgur.com/VQPk2DJ.png" alt="bud with wrench" class="logo">
        
        <h1>Hang on to your posts!</h1>
        
        <p>Sorry posting comrades, but we are currently performing essential security updates to the National Discussion Forum.</p>
        
        <p>We anticipate that the Discussion Forum will be back online and fully functional by <strong>Friday, November 20 at 3am PT / 6am ET</strong>. </p>
        
        <h2>Stay updated!</h2>
        <p>You can always check the uptime status for the forum and all NTC-hosted services <a href="https://status.ntc.dsausa.org">here</a>.</p>
		
		<p class="signature">- Your DSA Discussion Forum Admin Team</p>

        </div>

        
    </div>
</body>
</html>
